<title>UK: Toyota unit sets $400 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Toyota unit sets $400 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA CREDIT CANADA INC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  TOYOTA MOTOR FINANCE NETHERLANDS (WHICH HAS KEEPWELL</p>
<p>		AGREEMENT WITH TOYOTA MOTOR CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
